---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/founder-operator-retro-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/founder-operator-retro-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Ten silent minutes come before anyone reads a note aloud"
  caption="The run sheet I use for a 55-minute retro."
>
  A 55-minute retro on a time axis. Welcome and warm-up, minutes 0 to 3. Set the scene, 3 to 8. Silent brainstorm, 8 to
  18. Read out and cluster, 18 to 33. Vote, 33 to 36. Discuss the top two or three, 36 to 48. Commitments, 48 to 53.
  Close, 53 to 55.
</Chart>
